WEBVTT

00:00:13.186 --> 00:00:15.400
<v><b>I:</b></v> What did you do last weekend?

00:00:15.457 --> 00:00:19.920
<v><b>S:</b></v> Last weekend it was my birthday, so I went out for a meal with friends,

00:00:20.068 --> 00:00:24.465
and it was very sunny as well, so we went for a long walk afterwards.

00:00:33.638 --> 00:00:36.208
<v><b>I:</b></v> Where did you go for your last holiday?

00:00:36.668 --> 00:00:38.612
<v><b>J:</b></v> I went to Japan for Christmas.

00:00:47.019 --> 00:00:49.984
<v><b>I:</b></v> When was the last time you went to a restaurant?

00:00:49.985 --> 00:00:52.568
<v><b>R:</b></v> The last time I went to a restaurant, er,

00:00:52.569 --> 00:00:55.240
was over the weekend.

00:00:55.241 --> 00:00:58.733
I went to Sweetwater, in, er,

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:00.304
it’s a French restaurant in Brooklyn.

00:01:00.305 --> 00:01:01.801
<v><b>I:</b></v> Did you enjoy the meal?

00:01:01.802 --> 00:01:03.594
<v><b>R:</b></v> I loved it. It was great.

00:01:13.085 --> 00:01:15.325
<v><b>I:</b></v> Are you good at giving directions?

00:01:15.765 --> 00:01:18.351
<v><b>C:</b></v> No, I’m not.

00:01:18.352 --> 00:01:20.701
I am the worst person to ask for directions.

00:01:20.702 --> 00:01:24.751
I myself am not good at finding places or following directions,

00:01:24.752 --> 00:01:27.348
so I pretty much am not good at it.

00:01:38.145 --> 00:01:40.178
<v><b>I:</b></v> Is there a good café near here?

00:01:40.179 --> 00:01:42.490
<v><b>S:</b></v> Yes, there is. It’s just along on the right.